docs/progress-archive/progresstracking-2026-04_sprints-1-to-6.md:2243:**ArchivalPoller:** Added `api_costs` aggregate+delete via atomic CTE — single statement: candidates (LIMIT 5000) → aggregate by (business_id, provider, date) → upsert into rollups with additive `ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE` → delete candidates. Batched cycles don't double-count because UPSERT is additive. Added `notification_deliveries` straight delete (>90d). 5-target logging: `outbox, events, demos, api_costs, notifications`. Per-target saturation warning lists exactly which tables hit the 5000 batch limit.
