docs/reviews/feat-645-manual-suppression-paths/branch-review-adversarial-round2.md:7:| 3 | VERIFIED, limited | `retain_compliance_limited_pii` with whole-row retention is appropriate. The verifier is not vacuous: it detects an account-scoped correction whose `account_id` was wrongly nulled while its creator still identifies the offboarding account. It cannot prove retention after deletion, full scrubbing, or creator/note-only scrubbing—an acknowledged limitation of post-purge violation counting. [table-disposition.ts](/Users/norbertesekiel/Developer/startups/RepWorth-worktrees/feat-645-manual-suppression-paths/src/lib/account-offboarding/table-disposition.ts:403), [purge-verification.ts](/Users/norbertesekiel/Developer/startups/RepWorth-worktrees/feat-645-manual-suppression-paths/src/lib/account-offboarding/purge-verification.ts:665) |
