docs/directory.md:589:| `add-location-tx.ts` | `addLocationTransaction(sql, input)` — atomic add in one `sql.begin()`: lifecycle advisory lock, offboarding gate, `businesses` INSERT (`is_primary = FALSE`, voice config cloned from the primary unless the wizard overrides it), Import consent inherited from an archived sibling **(#677)**, `location_created` audit row, then `enqueueValidatePlaceId` / `enqueueStripeOverageRecompute`. Maps 23505 to `duplicate_location`. |
docs/directory.md:633:| `run-spine.ts` | Single writer API for `agent_runs`, `agent_run_steps`, and `agent_outcomes`, including the authoritative step-to-persona map and idempotent active-run/outcome constraints. |
