docs/progresstracking.md:282:**Lessons captured** (`.claude/reference/lab-notes.md`, 2026-06-08): tests asserting on **mocked** provider responses / SQL **text** let API/schema drift sail through CI (D1 + D3) — integration-test the billing + purge paths against the real Stripe API / staging schema; `railway up` from a nested worktree ships stale worker code (deploy from a clean clone); Stripe Basil/Dahlia moved `current_period_end` onto the subscription item; the `enforce_account_offboarding_purge_after_token_expiry` trigger blocks shortening `purge_after` while a keep-my-data token is live (revoke it first).
