docs/reviews/PATHFINDER-2026-08-10/01-flowcharts/f3-on-demand-generation.md:267:**Route-level (Generate door), in order:** 429 `rate_limited` (rate before budget — `generate/route.ts:47` vs `:90`), 404 `review_not_found`, 402/403 not-writable/offboarding, 429 `regen_limit_reached` (budget exhausted — advisory peek; fails open on Upstash outage, D-F: absent map entry = proceed, absent key = `used:0`). In-tx: `already_answered`, `draft_already_exists`, `orphan_recovery_pending`, `regenerate_in_progress` (all 409).
docs/reviews/PATHFINDER-2026-08-10/01-flowcharts/f3-on-demand-generation.md:269:**Regenerate door extras:** 503 `feature_disabled` (**`EDIT_REPLIES_ENABLED` gates this side only** — via `resolveEditReplyScope`, `edit-reply-request.ts:56`), tier gate, mode-dependent offboarding class, 409 `held_for_review` on resume of a held draft (F5 refusal, `draft/route.ts:154`), OCC 409s (`review_changed`/`response_changed`) — no OCC on the Generate side (nothing live to be concurrent with), and **no budget peek** (worker gate only).
