docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-01-suppression-ledger-core.md:699:In `purge-stages.ts`, inside the **existing** advisory-locked transaction at `:283-320` (which already holds `acquireCsvIngestLock` then `acquireSolicitationBatchLock`, in that order, per business). Do **not** open a new transaction and do **not** add a new advisory lock — the ledger is not written by CSV ingest, so it is outside both locks' contracts, and inventing a third lock risks the ABBA class the existing docstrings guard against.
